          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "What do you think about using lavender in a cocktail? I've been thinking of experimenting with it, and I'm curious if you have any recommendations for a good lavender syrup recipe or a cocktail that pairs well with it. By the way, speaking of gin, I've been experimenting with different Negroni recipes at home, and I've found that the Hendrick's gin really brings out the flavors."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-08-11",
            "sequence": 2,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155617360832000-316"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's really helpful, thanks! I'll definitely try out that lavender syrup recipe and experiment with the cocktails you suggested. By the way, speaking of experimenting with cocktails, I've been trying to perfect my Negroni recipe and I've found that using Hendrick's gin and Carpano Antica vermouth really brings out the flavors. I've tried making it at home for 5 times now since Emma teached me how to make it, and I'm getting closer to getting it just right. Do you have any recommendations for other bitter liqueurs I could try in place of Campari?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-08-11",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155863734714000-417"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "That's really interesting, I'll definitely try out some of those bitter liqueurs and see how they change the flavor profile of my Negroni. I've been meaning to experiment with a White Negroni, actually. I've heard it's a great way to showcase the gin and bitter liqueur. Do you have a good recipe for a White Negroni, or any tips on how to balance the flavors?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-08-11",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791156083987844000-488"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm also curious about using different types of citrus in my cocktails. I've been experimenting with grapefruit and lemon, but I want to try out some other options. Do you have any recommendations for citrus fruits that pair well with gin and lavender?"
